up ingestion rules for User Reported Phishing","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":268},{"title":"Transform user-reported phishing emails to security incidents","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":276},{"title":"Transform user-reported phishing emails to security incidents","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":301},{"title":"Define User Reported Phishing properties","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":309},{"title":"activate","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/getting-started-phishing-playbook.md","line":330},{"title":"Activate a Security Incident Response flow","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/getting-started-phishing-playbook.md","line":354},{"title":"Transform user-reported phishing emails to security incidents","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":362},{"title":"Set up ingestion rules for User Reported Phishing","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":381},{"title":"Transform user-reported phishing emails to security incidents","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":384},{"title":"Security incident records created from phishing email records","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":435},{"title":"Define User Reported Phishing properties","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":457},{"title":"Transform user-reported phishing emails to security incidents","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":473},{"title":"Transform user-reported phishing emails to security incidents","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md","line":511}],"metadata":{"title":"Create security incidents from User Reported Phishing emails","description":"Use this feature to create security incidents from user reported phishing emails.The User Reported Phishing feature available is an enhanced version of the existing user reported phishing functionality. See Create rules to validate user-reported phishing attacks.As a user with the sn\\_si.admin role, you can define email matching rules to filter user reported phishing emails based on specific criteria. For example, you can define a rule where all emails sent either directly or through the Report Phish button to security@acme.com are categorized as user reported phishing emails.Define the header information that must be captured from user reported phishing emails.User reported phishing emails are converted to security incidents based on the email matching rules that have been defined.The Transform Phishing Email to Security Incident flow converts or transforms phishing email records to security incidents.Phishing email records stored in the sn\\_si\\_phishing\\_email table are converted to security incidents records.You can view security incidents associated with the phishing email records in the Security Analyst Workspace.This section covers some of the frequently asked questions about the enhanced User Reported Phishing feature.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.html","release":"australia","product":"Security Incident Response","classification":"security-incident-response","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":24,"breadcrumb":["Security incident automatic creation","Security incident creation","Security Incident Response","Enterprise security case management applications","Security Operations"],"tags":["#security-management","#sir","#security-incidents","#investigation","#soar","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:ServiceNowOfficialDocs/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"uwcx5n","at":1784561352532},"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/security-management/security-incident-response/urp-about.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,20],"size":1912,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
